xalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-12T03:20:38-07:00","id":1318003,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElfSpeaker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1302200-the-fall-of-jiara-dragon-blooded-actual-play-by-the-story-told?p=1317876#post1317876\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks for the feedback! It's always great to hear when people are enjoying it.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's great, I'm enjoying all the written material (typo on the last &quot;Anathem&quot;[a] here: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/wikis/jiara\" target=\"_blank\">https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/wikis/jiara</a>).<br /> <br /> I do struggle listening to podcasts and the like, but the summarys have been great. If you're willing to transcribe some of your favourite bits I'd love that too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-12T04:20:33-07:00","id":1318014,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1302200-the-fall-of-jiara-dragon-blooded-actual-play-by-the-story-told?p=1318003#post1318003\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's great, I'm enjoying all the written material (typo on the last &quot;Anathem&quot;[a] here: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/wikis/jiara\" target=\"_blank\">https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/wikis/jiara</a>).<br /> <br /> I do struggle listening to podcasts and the like, but the summaries have been great. If you're willing to transcribe some of your favorite bits I'd love that too.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm glad to know someone beyond my players is reading the game too! And I appreciate the typo finding; there's never enough time to get a good edit in so I fix these as people point them out. Unfortunately, between game prep, work, audio editing, and family, I don't have the time to create a full transcript. That said, if you want more written material, check out the campaign listed in my signature, which was not recorded, and so the full session info made it into the session log. Though I suspect that one will have even more typos due to the volume of writing. :-)<br /> <br /> I also used to struggle to listen to podcasts and other audio content and found two things that helped. First, I need to make sure I'm doing something manual (driving, yardwork, painting, etc.) to stop my mind from wandering. Second, I increase the playback speed to x1.5. Hope that helps!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":702,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","user":"ElfSpeaker","date":". 06-12-2019, 07:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-16T06:33:41-07:00","id":1318840,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElfSpeaker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1302200-the-fall-of-jiara-dragon-blooded-actual-play-by-the-story-told?p=1318014#post1318014\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And I appreciate the typo finding; there's never enough time to get a good edit in so I fix these as people point them out.</div> </div> </div> </div>Pointing one out now, on <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/characters/peleps-meara\" target=\"_blank\">Peleps Meara's page</a>. Fairly sure it should be &quot;friend&quot;.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> She had returned closer to the Realm for her arranged marriage to V'neef Kai, who was a <span style=\"color:red\">fried</span> from secondary school at the Cloister of Wisdom. </div> </div> </div>Also <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log/session-3-part-2\" target=\"_blank\">session 3 part 2</a> doesn't have a link to the <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com/fall-of-jiara-episode-7\" target=\"_blank\">episode log</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":487,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","user":"Greyman","date":". 06-16-2019, 09:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-16T07:15:06-07:00","id":1318855,"title":"","content":"Fixed and added, thank you so much!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofji