ing at all to say the least) that I have actually found pleasure in. Why ? It is your groups role playing abilities. You have a good group, and (I am only at episode 5 at current) I find myself interested in your players characters, which is rare. But your group is indeed strong, and you are indeed a very good Game Master. So yeah, this is hardly an important post, I just wanted to give you some metaphorical flowers, that is all <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24253-magnus-k","name":"Magnus K","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-30T04:22:27-07:00","id":1344630,"title":"","content":"Hi <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24253-magnus-k\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24253\" data-vbnamecard=\"24253\">Magnus K</a>, This is definitely an important post and is the kind that keeps us going. I mean we play for our own enjoyment, but we edit for listeners like you. Thanks for your kind feedback - I'll share it with my players as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com