typically not a big fan of dynastic dragonblooded, but listening to this game inspired me to create a Dragonblooded character I <i>would</i> want to play if I were participating, so thanks for that too!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2118,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2118-reminiscent-oasis","user":"Reminiscent Oasis","date":". 01-10-2020, 12:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2118-reminiscent-oasis","name":"Reminiscent Oasis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2118_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"158"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-09T12:06:45-08:00","id":1359936,"title":"","content":"Awesome! I'm glad to hear you're enjoying it and that it's inspiring character for you. What is it that you typically don't like about the dynastic DBs?<br /> =","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-09T21:36:01-08:00","id":1360051,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElfSpeaker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1302200-the-fall-of-jiara-dragon-blooded-actual-play-by-the-story-told?p=1359936#post1359936\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What is it that you typically don't like about the dynastic DBs?<br /> =</div> </div> </div> </div>The short version is that I'm not a big fan of the Scarlet Dynasty's naked imperialism. More &quot;What have the Romans ever done for us?&quot; / Dragonblooded's Burden style apologia would help on that front, which this edition may have added. Still haven't gotten around to reading much of the DB book or any of the Realm book yet. Also characters born with a jade spoon in their mouths usually don't appeal to me. Of course, I can tell already that one or two of the characters in this game aren't terribly happy with the politics of the Realm either.<br /> <br /> So the character that got inspired here is an outcaste who grew up under a Legion boot rather than wearing one.<br /> <br /> Side note: in a few episodes, there's mention of associated artwork, but I haven't seen any of that. Is it online somewhere?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2118,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2118-reminiscent-oasis","user":"Reminiscent Oasis","date":". 01-10-2020, 03:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2118-reminiscent-oasis","name":"Reminiscent Oasis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2118_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"158"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-10T04:58:39-08:00","id":1360101,"title":"","content":"Noah, who plays Sanzo, has done some sketches, but nothing final yet. I'll post it here when we do have art to share.<br /> <br /> Yeah, that view of the Realm is pretty pervasive, and the new edition leans into it rather than walking it back any. My players wanted to examine what that means for each of them through their characters.<br /> <br /> Personally, I'd love to do the &quot;what have the Romans done for us&quot; version of the Realm as well to give it some more complexity. Actually, just last week, I started thinking about a region where that could be the paradigm. More may follow...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-10T05:48:20-08:00","id":1360109,"title":"","content":"I'm looking forward to seeing the art. <br /> <br /> I have to say I'm a little disappointed to hear that the Realm hasn't been giving some more complexity in that regarded. I don't want to drag out old arguments, but that's a drum I had been beating back in the formative days of 3rd Edition. The Realm needs some nuance so a moralistic character might justify their service to the Realm. Give them something to fight for beyond &quot;Queen and Country.&quot; Even if the infrastructure the Realm brings to a conquered region is meager compared to that of the Blessed Isle and exists primarily to reinforce their political and economic domination of the region, at least the character can point to them and say &quot;Without our engineers, you wouldn't have clean water. Without our geomancers, your fields would not be as bountiful. Without our training, your streets would not be as safe. Without our scholars, your libraries would not be brimming with knowledge collected from around the world.&quot; In time, they may still come to view this as inadequate compensation for the Realm's imperialism but at least there's a foundation and an alternative pathway for such a character.<br /> <br /> They might be able to pull off the training one now, since retired mortal legionnaires have to go somewhere. They can also talk about defending mortals from the onerous burden of avaricious spirits and from the barbarian hordes of the Lunar anathema, but we'd need to see both being a more serious problem beyond the borders of the Realm than we currently do. Perhaps as we get more information about the Threshold in this edition, we'll see more of these issues manifest in regions beyond the Realm's influence.<br /> <br /> Of course, my opinion on this might also be colored by the fact that I'm listening to a story about Dragonblooded in a satrapy in open rebellion rather than one where they're defending from invasion. Guess I'll just have to see what else you have in store as the group continues on the road to Daric and beyond.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2118-reminiscent-oasis","name":"Reminiscent Oasis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2118_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"158"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-10T05:57:02-08:00","id":1360111,"title":"","content":"I think you'll be happy with how things play out.<br /> <br /> WFHW and The Realm do present more satrapies that are not rebellious or on the verge of rebellion than the previous editions, but keeping with Ex3s approach, they're often like a paragraph each. I do think it's a more nuanced presentation, but it's been done with a show don't tell approach. The Immaculate Order chapter in the Realm actually has the most nuance, casting the Order as one aspect of the Realm that really does push to make things better for the common people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-10T06:36:38-08:00","id":1360117,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElfSpeaker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1302200-the-fall-of-jiara-dragon-blooded-actual-play-by-the-story-told?p=1360111#post1360111\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Immaculate Order chapter in the Realm actually has the most nuance, casting the Order as one aspect of the Realm that really does push to make things better for the common people.</div> </div> </div> </div>Appropriately enough, one of the two versions of the character you guys inspired (the one where he's discovered by the Realm early on and sent to the Blessed Isle) is an Immaculate monk with a favorable view of the Order. At least they attempt to restrain the excesses of the Dynasts and lead the charge against the Anathema - whom he has no love for either.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2118,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2118-reminiscent-oasis","user":"Reminiscent Oasis","date":". 01-10-2020, 11:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2118-reminiscent-oasis","name":"Reminiscent Oasis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2118_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"158"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-11T10:51:13-08:00","id":1360352,"title":"","content":"So, I have been listening to this quite regularly now, on the commute, but also on several longer walks during the holidays. Love it! I think you and your group have a very nice chemistry going. And I really enjoy listening to you present your version of Exalted to me. A big thank you to your crew and, of course, to you, the ST.<br /> <br /> If I'm being perfectly honest here, I'd kill to play with a group like this. This kind of play that is focused on the narrative and where all players totally immerse themselves in the characters is how I want to play. I know that you edit the podcast, but I still think you have a pretty focused game overall. I'm pretty sure you'd be OK if you just posted the game-session without too much cutting and editing.<br /> Anyway...just wanted to say thanks. And if you ever need a guest-player or something like that, I'd volunteer immediately (although time-zone differences might make this impossible, even if you were interested <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25439-mnemon-liranan","name":"Mnemon Liranan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25439_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-11T17:40:39-08:00","id":1360408,"title":"","content":"Just finished the Temple of Maykoy episode and I have to say that your group is <i>much</i> more deferential to the god than my group has traditionally been. Of course, that may be because they got burned by some minor god they went out of their way to assuage in their first game. After that, if they were in this situation, they'd be looking for a more pliable field god to promote and a new signature crop for Jiara after they burned all the asparagus they could find - or at least threatening to do so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2118,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2118-reminiscent-oasis","user":"Reminiscent Oasis","date":". 01-11-2020, 09:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2118-reminiscent-oasis","name":"Reminiscent Oasis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2118_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"158"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-13T05:42:30-08:00","id":1360678,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25439-mnemon-liranan\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar25439_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"25439\" data-vbnamecard=\"25439\">Mnemon Liranan</a> Thank you for for your enthusiasm! Comments like that go a long way to keeping us motivated to keep doing this. I do very occasionally call for guest players in specific NPC roles. If you are interested in talking with us directly, come join our Discord server: <a href=\"https://discord.gg/yBq5FAm\" target=\"_blank\">https://discord.gg/yBq5FAm</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-20T05:06:56-08:00","id":1362086,"title":"","content":"The final episode of act 1 is now available: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com/fall-of-jiara-23\" target=\"_blank\">http://thestorytold.libsyn.com/fall-of-jiara-23</a><br /> <br /> This one was a blast to play out and I think all the characters get some cool spotlight moments. We are going to be taking a break from airing episodes to prepare up for act 2. We originally started out 1-2 sessions ahead of the episodes we were airing, but with scheduling, holidays, and other unforeseen delays, we ended up getting into a real editing treadmill getting episodes out every two weeks. The break will let me build up a buffer of episodes again, reintroduce the player interviews at the beginning of the episodes, and offer an entry point at the beginning of act 2 for new listeners to jump in. We'll be back in a couple months!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-10T05:07:20-08:00","id":1366743,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElfSpeaker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1302200-the-fall-of-jiara-dragon-blooded-actual-play-by-the-story-told?p=1360678#post1360678\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25439-mnemon-liranan\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar25439_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"25439\" data-vbnamecard=\"25439\">Mnemon Liranan</a> Thank you for for your enthusiasm! Comments like that go a long way to keeping us motivated to keep doing this. I do very occasionally call for guest players in specific NPC roles. If you are interested in talking with us directly, come join our Discord server: <a href=\"https://discord.gg/yBq5FAm\" target=\"_blank\">https://discord.gg/yBq5FAm</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Hey ElfSpeaker,<br /> <br /> You're welcome, I believe in letting people know that their hard work is appreciated, especially if they offer it all for free. Glad if stuff like this keeps your motivation up, then I reached my goal <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Sorry for the late response, but I do not frequent this forum that often and I had to switch computers on top of that. But it is all sorted out now ^^<br /> Thanks for the heads up. I don't really know discord all that well but I'm sure I'll take a look. A guest-role would be an honor. Although fair warning, English is not my mother-tongue (I'm sure it shows in writing as well).<br /> <br /> Thanks again for sharing your stories with us!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25439-mnemon-liranan","name":"Mnemon Liranan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25439_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-04T16:06:48-07:00","id":1406344,"title":"","content":"Oh. Oh! The story is getting back on track.<br /> <br /> They've just released a <a href=\"https://thestorytold.libsyn.com/fall-of-jiara-act-1-summary-recounting-of-the-past\" target=\"_blank\">Summary of Act One</a>, with each player recounting highlights of the adventure from their character's perspective.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-04T16:42:00-07:00","id":1406349,"title":"","content":"Thank you for posting! I knew I had missed somewhere. We'll be returning to our usual schedule of releasing every two weeks. Like many things, the show got delayed by COVID.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-05T03:21:38-07:00","id":1406406,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElfSpeaker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1302200-the-fall-of-jiara-dragon-blooded-actual-play-by-the-story-told?p=1406349#post1406349\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thank you for posting! I knew I had missed somewhere. We'll be returning to our usual schedule of releasing every two weeks. Like many things, the show got delayed by COVID.</div> </div> </div> </div>Question(s) regarding Shao Dun. <br /> 1) what is his rank? In Act One he\u2019s consistently regretted to as a winglord, though the context in Episode 1 would imply he\u2019s a talonlord (you skipped scale when going up the unit sizes), and in the recap he\u2019s referred to as a dragonlord. <br /> 2) he has the beard and the halberd of one of his Romance inspirations, the name of the other, and the unswerving loyalty of both. When is he going to lose an eye to complete the theme?<br /> <br /> Also, thanks so much for bringing this Actual Play to us.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1424-ghanjrho","name":"GhanjRho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1424_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-05T04:32:28-07:00","id":1406411,"title":"","content":"Woops! That's my mistake. He was winglord and in the intervening time, I forgot. I'll make sure we go back to that. He shuld be a winglord rather than a talonlord. He had command over all the military forces of Meara's expedition. Only one ship accompanied them to Jiara, which limits the toops on hand. But I was thinking in the navy, the expedition captain would be dragonlord and the marine commander would be winglord regardless of exact numers. (That's my head conan anyway.)<br /> <br /> Shao is indeed an homage to the Romance of the Three Kingdoms, which Jeremy has read several times. I'm only passingly familar, but thanks to your input, I'll have to start aiming for the eye!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-05T05:17:31-07:00","id":1406415,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElfSpeaker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1302200-the-fall-of-jiara-dragon-blooded-actual-play-by-the-story-told?p=1406349#post1406349\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thank you for posting! I knew I had missed somewhere. We'll be returning to our usual schedule of releasing every two weeks. Like many things, the show got delayed by COVID.</div> </div> </div> </div>Such mixed feelings...<br /> <br /> On the one hand, delight, because this is the best actual play I've ever listened to for any game ever. Audio, story, chemistry -- all top notch.<br /> <br /> On the other hand, despair, I have no time to listen to podcasts (as I said way back in June 2019). I only got the chance to become a fan when I was communiting to school (which remains closed due to Covid).<br /> <br /> Here's hoping school opens again in September!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-05T05:28:47-07:00","id":1406416,"title":"","content":"Wow, that's high praise; thank you!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-19T03:20:07-07:00","id":1409102,"title":"","content":"Excellent. Starting off act two with a tasty aperitif.<br /> <br /> The crew has split up for four <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log/fall-of-jiara-interlude\" target=\"_blank\">Downtime vinegrettes</a> with character building and plot seeding a plenty.<br /> <br /> Crafting. Politics. Spying. Training. Action! Romance? Exploration. All the noice things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-19T07:49:24-07:00","id":1409136,"title":"","content":"Thank you for posting the link! I need to get back in the routine of posting here each time we release. I appreciate the fans stepping up to share it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-31T08:40:31-07:00","id":1411226,"title":"","content":"We have the next episode of the Fall of Jiara up now: <a href=\"https://thestorytold.libsyn.com/fall-of-jiara-25\" target=\"_blank\">https://thestorytold.libsyn.com/fall-of-jiara-25</a><br /> <br /> This is the first episode of our actual play sessoins for act 2!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-14T07:40:42-07:00","id":1413563,"title":"","content":"Part 2 of session 1 from act 2 is up now: <a href=\"https://thestorytold.libsyn.com/fall-of-jiara-26\" target=\"_blank\">https://thestorytold.libsyn.com/fall-of-jiara-26</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T04:25:41-07:00","id":1414171,"title":"","content":"I've been meaning to thank you guys for the great timing. The second arc started just in time for me to go back to my normal work schedule post-shutdown, so it's definitely been a help there.<br /> <br /> In this week's outro interview, Logan mentions / jokes he's suspicious that Noah is actually playing a Lunar, but does Kai himself harbor any suspicious? Way back before the world fell apart, we had privately discussed on Discord the possibility of in-game characters growing suspicious of Sanzo as a possible Lunar, so I'm curious to see if that might be coming to fruition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2118-reminiscent-oasis","name":"Reminiscent Oasis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2118_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"158"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T05:11:01-07:00","id":1414178,"title":"","content":"I'm glad to hear our timing worked for you! It would not have been as good if we had tried to push through since none of us were in the headspace to come back to Jiara at the beginning of the pandemic.<br /> <br /> I know Logan is suspicious of Sanzo, but doesn't actually think he's a Lunar. Kai is also suspicious, and has orders from the All Seeing Eye to watch Sanzo, so knows he's not the sop he presents. But I don't think there's any suspicion that he's a Lunar. Going forward in this act, there's going to be a lot of players having suspecious but playing into their characters not knowing. It's been super fun to play out!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-01T03:59:29-07:00","id":1416223,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElfSpeaker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1302200-the-fall-of-jiara-dragon-blooded-actual-play-by-the-story-told?p=1414178#post1414178\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm glad to hear our timing worked for you! It would not have been as good if we had tried to push through since none of us were in the headspace to come back to Jiara at the beginning of the pandemic.</div> </div> </div> </div>Can't blame you there. Luckily for me, my friends and I got to play our own Lunar-centric game for a while during the bulk of the shutdown. Now that we're all heading back to a semblance of normalcy though, we haven't been able to play as regularly.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I know Logan is suspicious of Sanzo, but doesn't actually think he's a Lunar. Kai is also suspicious, and has orders from the All Seeing Eye to watch Sanzo, so knows he's not the sop he presents. But I don't think there's any suspicion that he's a Lunar. Going forward in this act, there's going to be a lot of players having suspecious but playing into their characters not knowing. It's been super fun to play out! </div> </div> </div>I completely forgot that Kai is involved with the All Seeing Eye. Has that come up in-game at all?<br /> <br /> I just finished listening to the most recent episode. I'm looking forward to seeing what happens as a certain nut gets cracked. <br /> <br /> I'm trying to remember if we've heard much about the potential suitors beyond the Cathak that just showed up and that the others seem to have been chosen in a way that don't obviously benefit House Ledaal. Was there anything else about them in prior episodes that I'm forgetting? Hopefully there will be a future Bachelorette episode where we get to see who the other potential suitors are.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2118-reminiscent-oasis","name":"Reminiscent Oasis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2118_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"158"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-01T05:26:13-07:00","id":1416229,"title":"","content":"Salana Tovin is Kai's primary Eye contact, so it has come up in that sense. It hasn't come up much beyond that. Originally, I was planning to push more from the Eye to get info about Sanzo, but that thread has never quite fit the situation.<br /> <br /> The suitors will all make their appearance in time. We've recorded one more introduction at this point and are laying the hooks to bring in the others. And yes, I am definitely planning a bachelorette episode where the suitors have to parade themselves before Prince Ozria. But there are some complications to sort out before we get to that...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-01T05:27:20-07:00","id":1416231,"title":"","content":"And here's the link to the latest episode: <a href=\"https://thestorytold.libsyn.com/fall-of-jiara-27\" target=\"_blank\">https://thestorytold.libsyn.com/fall-of-jiara-27</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-04T01:19:44-07:00","id":1416698,"title":"","content":"I started listening just recently and I have binged through eight episodes so far. This is really great stuff.<br /> <br /> For more than fifteen years <b>Exalted</b> was my favorite gameline, but I completely burned out on it after the debacle that was the Kickstarter and the overwhelming bloat that was the third edition core. This podcast is reminding me why I loved it in the first place. Among other things, it brings back memories of a first edition Dragon-Blooded chronicle I was the storyteller of back in 2004,<b> The First Dance Macabre</b>, dealing with the fall of Thorns.<br /> <br /> Anyway, all of the characters and characters are genuinely pretty great, but the one that really resonates with me as a character I would want to play is Tepet Sanzo.<br /> <br /> The moment I was hooked to the podcast came in episode 5:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Lynn: &quot;I have heard that House Tepet has fallen on hard times. That when they faced the Anathema in the North, they were\u2026 unprepared. Their battle lines ill organized and the defeat and subsequent rout an embarrassment for a House that prides itself on military tradition.&quot;<br /> <br /> Tepet Sanzo: &quot;That is all very true. They were idiots.&quot;</div></div> </div> </div><br /> Finally, good on you for making the White Veil Society a little less infuriating than it is presented in the books.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.redbubble.com/people/nesling/works/15673780-loch-ness-monster-on-vacation?c=409846-mixed&amp;p=throw-pillow\" target=\"_blank\">Loch Ness monsters. On vacation. On a pillow.</a><br /> <br /> <br /> My wife is on <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/1Ngo336SKXWmoRnG3QWmhS\" target=\"_blank\">Spotify</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/864-jutlander","name":"Jutlander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-04T05:14:21-07:00","id":1416711,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/864-jutlander\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"864\" data-vbnamecard=\"864\">Jutlander</a> Thank you so much for the feedback!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":